04 229 303L222 291L189 157Q156 26 151 16Q138 -11 108 -11Q95 -11 87 -5T76 7T74 17Q74 30 112 180T152 343Q153 348 153 366Q153 405 129 405Q91 405 66 305Q60 285 60 284Q58 278 41 278H27Q21 284 21 287Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E18-MJMAIN-29\" d=\"M60 749L64 750Q69 750 74 750H86L114 726Q208 641 251 514T294 250Q294 182 284 119T261 12T224 -76T186 -143T145 -194T113 -227T90 -246Q87 -249 86 -250H74Q66 -250 63 -250T58 -247T55 -238Q56 -237 66 -225Q221 -64 221 250T66 725Q56 737 55 738Q55 746 60 749Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E18-MJMATHI-78\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E18-MJMAIN-2261\" x=\"850\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E18-MJMATHI-75\" x=\"1906\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E18-MJMATHI-62\" x=\"2479\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E18-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"3130\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(3520,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E18-MJMAIN-6D\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E18-MJMAIN-6F\" x=\"833\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E18-MJMAIN-64\" x=\"1334\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E18-MJMATHI-6E\" x=\"5633\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E18-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"6233\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> is a solution. </p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Next, we prove the solution is unique:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>To prove uniqueness, we show that two solutions <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"2.384ex\" height=\"2.009ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -576.1 1026.4 865.1\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-19-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-19-Title\">x_1</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E19-MJMATHI-78\" d=\"M52 289Q59 331 106 386T222 442Q257 442 286 424T329 379Q371 442 430 442Q467 442 494 420T522 361Q522 332 508 314